      "content": "idk im just really worried about the money. if i just take the benadryl now, i can probably just sleep it off and see if its better in the morning? i feel like the throat thing is just from anxiety because i'm panicking. if i take like 50mg or something it should work right? i really dont want to go to the er if i dont have to.",
